{"event_type":"review","id":"a95537cdba52963e13f1164842ab1e3e9aaa3a26b37ea4d76c76f8af70db9809","occurred_at":"2026-11-02T04:04:39Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/59b20401becbcd4e3ef261020b69c07aca13e03c131994a349d8364ae1fddcf8","sha256":"59b20401becbcd4e3ef261020b69c07aca13e03c131994a349d8364ae1fddcf8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d0099686061fbb1453fa54148d514b6f6a6a6b0232d508cfc0ad72d3aeeed6cb","sha256":"d0099686061fbb1453fa54148d514b6f6a6a6b0232d508cfc0ad72d3aeeed6cb"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/01b01e78b7da87ec0f1b0216eba9c9dc0afff4f1b036d7a69a62f7d9fc3fbe45","sha256":"01b01e78b7da87ec0f1b0216eba9c9dc0afff4f1b036d7a69a62f7d9fc3fbe45"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5987376485f8e61440be4ad4b22652d525b8d0ed3838657f11e45ccfd1376bec","sha256":"5987376485f8e61440be4ad4b22652d525b8d0ed3838657f11e45ccfd1376bec"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8a4ede162fd5a75c1a2d46aaa4549a8b6c7e30365fe79e3b2344308bb2ff2356","sha256":"8a4ede162fd5a75c1a2d46aaa4549a8b6c7e30365fe79e3b2344308bb2ff2356"}],"attempt_id":"0eaccaa6d46e0423206f8feffbd6964b52e8500d6fea436d3d6ffe81e0ed6522:0:1","base":"35963ccaae497732bc6807d235f4b1b13ce49e9e","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6c0443cc9509e79040652577aeb04ddde1853e8b","body":"**The identity assertions can pass on stale state. Reset `reason` per subtest.**\n\n`refresh_deferred` clears `entry[\"reason\"]` only on a successful refresh. After the first subtest sets it, Line 73 can pass for `producer`, `target`, `repo`, and `pr` even if the refresh does nothing. The tail case at Lines 75-78 has the same problem. It checks only `items == []` and never checks the entry state or the reason.\n\nPop `reason` before each refresh. Also assert that the bad `mergeSha` case sets `reason` and keeps `awaiting-merge`.\n\n\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n             with self.subTest(key=key):\n-                self.entry.update(state=\"awaiting-merge\", pr=12)\n+                self.entry.update(state=\"awaiting-merge\", pr=12)\n+                self.entry.pop(\"reason\", None)\n                 original = self.forge[key]\n@@\n         self.entry[\"state\"] = \"awaiting-merge\"\n+        self.entry.pop(\"reason\", None)\n         self.forge.update(state=\"MERGED\", mergeSha=\"bad\")\n         self.run_refresh()\n         self.assertEqual(self.q[\"items\"], [])\n+        self.assertEqual(self.entry[\"state\"], \"awaiting-merge\")\n+        self.assertEqual(self.entry[\"reason\"][\"category\"], \"identity\")\n```\n</details>","id":"1fd9a93ad680adf2a1d3190038d5dd2f2d316405180002aa9c3d045536e168ed","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_deferred_refresh.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"The identity assertions can pass on stale state. Reset `reason` per subtest."}],"head":"6037870c41e85eab4ac10a2469b70ea2b457fb10","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"77455cdd6fdb5cd710107e20240a0e90e021e1cb","intervals":[[1,79]],"path":"apps/crq-python/capability_dispatcher.py"},{"blob":"c5d703fdf0c6a25b7f90a02faa32c45b61b2969e","intervals":[[1,99]],"path":"apps/crq-python/deferred_refresh.py"},{"blob":"30fffb6bc0bce26623c5290dcbb9f0c89c2aad99","intervals":[[1,402]],"path":"apps/crq-python/queue_transport.py"},{"blob":"d5fc53e567171872007ef8c6899a11ea12691730","intervals":[[2,2],[10,10],[18,18],[20,20],[30,416],[448,613],[616,621],[627,636],[662,663],[701,701],[708,710],[719,719],[981,981],[983,983],[997,2594]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_crq.py"},{"blob":"6c0443cc9509e79040652577aeb04ddde1853e8b","intervals":[[1,107]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_deferred_refresh.py"},{"blob":"9abd9